    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3308b16c020fed72da7f3fd6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……吉兆的回答绝非谎言。\n在任何状况下她都会贯彻自己的使命，\n她就是这样的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "caf38f0157ba4c8dd40d9facf1a5f7faebc6ca214876f8d1714244d9aaeb2cee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
