      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“吉兆在采访中，\n对谷野美酒也太冷淡了吧？\n替美酒感到有点难过。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "b352586383be9616c976bf9e00cc4d679f66ade32f665a6d2986a96d70812ec3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
