      "uid": "zhcn:a0b2b6d060dd101e1c394d7e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……为求在“天皇赏（秋）”必胜，\n我们持续进行着严苛训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db5f00c8fba785979133d16afe2557f697eb1894d4d278c7f68c194d80d7be1a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
